/users/yinsn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":188,"digest":"sha256:662d50271ead83ba797771d576aa1a0209b676c10057342570f791b7323714aa","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-03T09:20:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T09:20:33Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/releases/download/v0.2.25/SHA256SUMS"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/releases/assets/607520770","id":607520770,"node_id":"RA_kwDOUZPJh84kNggC","name":"UPDATE.zh-CN.txt","label":"","uploader":{"login":"yinsn","id":102125674,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhZQag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102125674?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn","html_url":"https://github.com/yinsn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":6009,"digest":"sha256:0c5c4c5ba21f2e607fb4e1334e663719bcb20001a428d4672493acb4190beb36","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-03T09:20:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T09:20:33Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/releases/download/v0.2.25/UPDATE.zh-CN.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/tarball/v0.2.25","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/zipball/v0.2.25","body":"# 释手 0.2.25 · 麦克风与扬声器分别使用\n\n构建：20261003-083729（UTC）\n\n## 本次改动\n\n启用「运行时固定系统麦克风」时，选择大疆等 USB 麦克风或开启录音后，释手会保护原先的声音播放设备。麦克风用于收音，Mac 自带扬声器或已选择的耳机继续播放。\n\n- 修复 USB 接收器延迟将声音输出切到麦克风时，未恢复原播放设备的问题。\n- 修复输出误指向没有播放声道的输入设备时，恢复流程被跳过的问题。\n- 重新插入已选择的接收器或从睡眠恢复时，会尝试恢复已记录且仍可用的独立播放设备；麦克风断开期间选择其他音箱或耳机，也保留新的选择。\n- 系统连续抢回输出时暂停固定并提示，避免来回切换。\n- 保留播放和系统提示音各自的设备；用户主动切换音箱或耳机时尊重新的选择。\n- 缺少已知且可用的原播放选择，或旧版已留下错误输出时，启用「运行时固定系统麦克风」时可在「声音播放」选择 Mac 自带扬声器；未启用时可在 macOS「系统设置 → 声音 → 输出」选回。\n- 保留原有模型、个人设置及听写流程，无需重新下载模型。\n\n轻量更新复用本机已有离线模型。\n\n## 更新方法\n\n- **0.2.2 或更新版本**：打开「设置 → 关于释手 → 检查更新 → 下载并更新」。\n- **0.2.1 或更早版本**：下载本次轻量更新包，退出释手，运行包内的 `FreeJotUpdater.app`，选择原来的完整离线应用，可直接升级到 0.2.25。\n- **新 Mac 首次安装**：按[完整安装指南](https://yinsn.github.io/FreeJot-Updates/INSTALL.md)安装含模型的 0.2.4 完整包，再在应用内更新到 0.2.25。\n"}